  "question": {
    "text": "A uniform thin rod&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>AB</mi></math> of length&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi></math> and mass&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi></math> is undergoing rotation about a fixed axis passing through end&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> and perpendicular to the rod, such that end&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> remains stationary as shown. The kinetic energy of section&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>AP</mi></math> of the rod is equal to the kinetic energy of section&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>BP</mi></math> of the rod at an instant. Then what is the value of <math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math>?(<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>AB</mi></math> and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>AP</mi></math> are lengths of respective parts of the rod)<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/ci/image24-182ae1ac-674d-4960-989a-459b22f73dc9.jpg\" />",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "2",
  "solution": {
    "text": "The KE of given section AP and PB will be equal if the moment of inertia of each section AP and section PB about A is same.<br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/ci/image25-24a337f1-98dc-49f1-a4ba-06f1a65e5bd3.jpg\" /><br /><br />Moment of inertia of segment AP w.r.t given axis <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi></math><br /><br />Moment of inertia of segment PB w.r.t given axis <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />(Moment of inertia or rod AB w.r.t. given axis is <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></math> )<br /><br /><math><mo>∴</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />Or <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>",
    "image": null
  },
